{"output":"I’ll read the bug description and implementation, make a targeted fix, and run the existing tests without changing the protected files.\n\nThe code changes the source balance before validating the target, and receipt keys are shared across tenants. I’ll validate balances before writing and reject changed payloads on replay while preserving the synchronous API and receipt shape.\n\nFixed validation before mutation, safe-integer balance checks, tenant-scoped idempotency, and changed-payload rejection. Preserved the synchronous API and receipt shape.\n\nVerification passed, exit 0: npm test, an inline node --input-type=module contract probe, and git diff --check.\n\nTests, README.md, and package files remain unchanged. No dependencies installed or blockers encountered.","final_output":"Fixed validation before mutation, safe-integer balance checks, tenant-scoped idempotency, and changed-payload rejection. Preserved the synchronous API and receipt shape.\n\nVerification passed, exit 0: npm test, an inline node --input-type=module contract probe, and git diff --check.\n\nTests, README.md, and package files remain unchanged. No dependencies installed or blockers encountered.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":9,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a; find .. -name AGENTS.md -print","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-apul1kbx/ledger-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":199,"stdout_bytes":118,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-321fc1da98299150d6d0263b56ae5d9e.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"ls src tests","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-apul1kbx/ledger-2-b